      "canonicalJson": "{\"applicability\":null,\"conditions\":[\"液力耦合器传递动力过程中\"],\"evidence_ids\":[\"book:1-XMC-sjwyrpWuWn1BJPpirxDEo8LZJvv:ev:p0060:e01\"],\"id\":\"claim:1-XMC-sjwyrpWuWn1BJPpirxDEo8LZJvv:c03s2t4:0002\",\"object_id\":\"book:1-XMC-sjwyrpWuWn1BJPpirxDEo8LZJvv:ent:k01\",\"pdf_pages\":[60],\"predicate\":\"occurs_in\",\"qualification_status\":\"EXTRACTED_UNCHECKED\",\"source_kind\":\"BOOK_BODY_DIRECT\",\"statement\":\"冲击损失发生于液力耦合器传递动力的过程中：油液回流到泵轮时因涡轮叶片的反作用，流动方向变为与泵轮转向相反；油液以多种方向回跳和散射以致流动受扰动，这种现象称为冲击损失。\",\"subject_id\":\"book:1-XMC-sjwyrpWuWn1BJPpirxDEo8LZJvv:ent:k23\"}",
