      "@type": "auto:Claim",
      "applicability": null,
      "assumptions": [],
      "canonicalJson": "{\"applicability\":null,\"evidence_ids\":[\"book:1-XMC-sjwyrpWuWn1BJPpirxDEo8LZJvv:ev:p0062:e04\"],\"id\":\"claim:1-XMC-sjwyrpWuWn1BJPpirxDEo8LZJvv:c03s2t4:0034\",\"pdf_pages\":[62],\"predicate\":\"function_analogy\",\"qualification_status\":\"EXTRACTED_UNCHECKED\",\"source_kind\":\"BOOK_BODY_DIRECT\",\"statement\":\"两个电扇组成的耦合器能传递转矩但不能增大转矩；添加管道后空气从电扇B回流到电扇A、增强电扇A吹出的气流；在液力变矩器中双向锁止导轮就起到了这种空气管道的作用（图3-7）。\",\"subject_id\":\"book:1-XMC-sjwyrpWuWn1BJPpirxDEo8LZJvv:ent:k07\",\"value\":\"在两电扇-管道类比（图3-7）中起空气管道的作用：使流过电扇B（被驱动风扇）后残余的能量经管道导回电扇A（驱动风扇）叶片后面促其旋转\"}",
      "conditions": [],
